    summary: "Ever feel like it's been too long since your last glitter shower?",
    description: "Overview: Ever feel like it's been too long since your last glitter shower? And maybe you have that feeling that you're starting to wreak of non-bedazzle? Glitter rockets have you covered! It's a particle party from the sky! This is a cross between stomp rickets and a glitter storm, because sometimes science needs to take a break, and you do, too. Let's get glittering! - What: GLITTER ROCKETS! - Why: Get out - Time: ~ 15 minu…\n\nMaterials:\n- See full materials list on the activity page.\n\nBuild Steps:\n1. Make a Launcher - Cut the bike valve out of your tube by cutting on both sides.\n2. Form a Paper Rocket - Roll a rectangular piece of paper around the PVC pipe.\n3. Launch That Glitter! - Load up some glitter, and why not throw a little in the tube for good measure?\n\nLearning Focus: joy, fun, everything, stomp rockets, air pressure, science\nOriginal Activity: https://www.instructables.com/Glitter-Rockets/",
