    title: "The Most Annoying Sound in the World",
    summary: "This is the party trick that ends the party.",
    description: "Overview: This is the party trick that ends the party. The alarm clock for your siblings that earns you a wedgie. This is THE MOST ANNOYING SOUND IN THE WORLD. It truly is. And it's annoying to difficulty ratio is wonderful. Oh yeah, and it's all because of science. If you're feeling too un-annoyed today, start with the video to listen in. Then imagine that at about ten times the volume right next to you. And then get a can a…\n\nMaterials:\n- See full materials list on the activity page.\n\nBuild Steps:\n1. Nab a Can - Any aluminum can will do!\n2. Prep That Can - Just two little adjustments to make.\n3. The Technique - Getting the resonance takes a bit of practice.\n4. Science! - Don't worry!\n\nLearning Focus: can, resonance, frequency, wavelength, sound, music\nOriginal Activity: https://www.instructables.com/The-Most-Annoying-Sound-in-the-World/",
