    subject: "STEAM Activity",
    title: "Instant Clouds: Just Add Pressure!",
    summary: "Time to make Zeus jealous.",
    description: "Overview: Time to make Zeus jealous. Mama always told you that you can plan a pretty picnic, but you can't control the weather. Well the forecast today is that your mama is, sadly, 100% wrong. With a little bit of pressure applied, a front of cloudy weather will be moving in to your bottle in less than a microsecond. You can re-create the same process that clouds go through when forming to make your very own pet cloud. There…\n\nMaterials:\n- See full materials list on the activity page.\n\nBuild Steps:\n1. The Fine Print: Materials, Science, and Caution - You are about to be the master of weather, and with that comes great responsibility.\n2. The Cloud Plug - Take your rubber stopper and the smallest drill bit you have (we used 1/16\").\n3. The Cloud Bottle - Take any labels off your cloud bottle so you can see it clearly.\n4. Pump It Up and Release! - Place your cloud plug into the bottle, and hold it there firmly.\n\nLearning Focus: cloud, pressure, science, education, weather, meteorology\nOriginal Activity: https://www.instructables.com/Instant-Cloud-Just-Add-Pressure/",
